Description: Crash-safe custom GIF animations for the BackBoard respring screen on rootless iOS 15 and 16. Version 3.4.0 adds 54 catalog-built-in downloadable CC0 themes alongside 12 offline themes, one-tap pinned HTTPS downloads, animated bounded previews, transactional staging that preserves every user-selected layout and playback setting, automatic Springy and SnowBoard discovery, safe GIF/ZIP/DEB/frame-folder import, and a 54-package legacy compatibility catalog without rehosting unlicensed artwork.
